(gen_random_uuid(), 'jobs-in-google-usa-20261125', 'usa', 'USA',
'Jobs in Google USA: Engineer Roles Pay Up to $300,000',
'Jobs in Google USA: Engineer Roles Pay Up to $300,000',
'Jobs in Google USA are open now, including a Staff Software Engineer in AI at $207,000 to $300,000 and a Senior Business Data Scientist at up to $236,000.',
'Jobs in Google USA are open now, including a Staff Software Engineer in AI at $207,000 to $300,000 and a Senior Business Data Scientist at up to $236,000.',
$$<p>Google are hiring engineers and data scientists across California and New York, with AI roles at the forefront of the current openings. Jobs in Google USA in this roundup pay from $138,000 to $300,000 a year in base salary (plus bonus target, equity and benefits).</p><table><tbody><tr><td>Organisation</td><td>Google</td></tr><tr><td>Post</td><td>Staff Software Engineer, AI/ML GenAI; Senior Business Data Scientist; Business Data Scientist</td></tr><tr><td>Pay</td><td>USD $138,000 to $300,000 a year in base pay, plus bonus, equity and benefits</td></tr><tr><td>Application dates</td><td>Posted 17 to 20 November 2026; no closing date stated</td></tr><tr><td>Application route</td><td>Online through Google Careers</td></tr><tr><td>Qualification</td><td>Relevant degree and experience; 8 or more years for the staff engineer post</td></tr><tr><td>Selection</td><td>Application and interview; English proficiency is required for global collaboration</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>What jobs in Google USA involve</h2><p>Google's software engineers are the next-generation technologies that change the way billions of people connect, explore and interact with information. The Staff Software Engineer in AI & ML is a staff level role in Generative AI (Sunnyvale or New York) with eight or more years experience. The Senior Business Data Scientist in Google Cloud is in Sunnyvale working on customer journey and product analytics to shape the product and support experience. The Business Data Scientist in AI Foundations is in San Jose. The Senior Software Engineer for Discover Feed Recommendations is in Mountain View. Google posted 95 developer roles over the last seven days, through 24 November 2026) with 75 of those in the San Francisco Bay Area. Those looking to explore other <a href="https://growentix.cloud/usa">USA jobs</a> can also take a look at our guide to <a href="https://growentix.cloud/articles/software-engineer-jobs-in-usa-for-foreigners-h-1b-pay-and-hiring-guide-20261029">software engineer jobs in the USA for foreigners</a> which covers the H-1B pathways into the US tech industry.</p><h2>Who can apply</h2><p>These are experienced hire roles, not student posts. The staff engineer post needs eight or more years of experience, the senior data scientist four or more, and the senior software engineer five or more. Google is a global company so English is a must for the roles in order to be able to work with people all over the world. The Student Researcher programme (which is a separate programme to these posts) is open until 27th November 2026 for students who won't be going on to full time employment and is not conversion eligible. Please check the level of experience required on each advert as Google label their posts as Mid, Senior or Advanced.</p><h2>What it pays</h2><p> Staff Software Engineer, AI/ML GenAI: US base salary of $207,000 to $300,000, plus a 20% bonus target, equity and benefits. Senior Business Data Scientist pays $163,000 to $236,000 plus a 15% bonus target, and the Business Data Scientist $138,000 to $197,000 plus a 15% bonus target. The Senior Software Engineer (Discover Feed Recommendations pays $174,000 to $252,000 plus a 15% bonus target. Google note that the compensation details in the US role postings are base salary only and do not include bonus, equity or benefits.</p><h2>How to apply</h2><p>Apply via Google Careers, searching for the role title and location. The Staff Software Engineer role was advertised on 20th November 2026 and the Senior Business Data Scientist role on 17th November. Both were still open on 24th November 2026. The Google ads state there is no fixed closing date so they can close when filled. Applications should show the specific programming languages and ML work mentioned in the advert).</p><h2>What the notice does not say</h2><p>No closing date is stated on any of the Google adverts checked, and no interview dates or start dates are given. The adverts do not say how many posts are open for each role. None of the adverts checked confirm visa sponsorship, so international applicants should check the live Google Careers advert before applying.</p><p><strong>Never pay anyone to apply for this job.</strong> Google Careers applications are free and Google will never ask you to pay anything for an application, an assessment or a job offer.</p><p>Sources: <a href="https://roleweek.com/job/staff-software-engineer-ai-ml-genai-google-workspace-google-san-francisco-bay-area-aaf4bfe2/">RoleWeek</a> (the Google Staff Software Engineer listing from the employer's job board: pay, locations and posting date); <a href="https://roleweek.com/job/senior-business-data-scientist-google-cloud-google-san-francisco-bay-area-cb2f46c5/">RoleWeek</a> (the Google Senior Business Data Scientist listing from the employer's job board: pay and posting date); <a href="https://www.codingjobboard.com/job/staff-software-engineer-at-google-usa/31740">Coding Job Board</a> (the Google Staff Software Engineer listing as published: pay and benefits).</p><h2>Frequently asked questions</h2><h3>What's the highest paying Google job?</h3><p>Staff Software Engineer, AI/ML GenAI, at $207,000 to $300,000 in base plus 20% bonus target, equity and benefits.</p><h3>When do applications close?</h3><p>There's no closing date on the Google ads that we checked so the roles could well close when filled.</p><h3>Where are these Google roles based?</h3><p>Sunnyvale, Mountain View, San Jose and San Francisco in California and New York.</p><h3>Are these roles for new grads?</h3><p>No, these are experienced hires. The staff engineer role is specifically looking for eight or more years' experience.</p>
$$,
$$<p>Google are hiring engineers and data scientists across California and New York, with AI roles at the forefront of the current openings. Jobs in Google USA in this roundup pay from $138,000 to $300,000 a year in base salary (plus bonus target, equity and benefits).</p><table><tbody><tr><td>Organisation</td><td>Google</td></tr><tr><td>Post</td><td>Staff Software Engineer, AI/ML GenAI; Senior Business Data Scientist; Business Data Scientist</td></tr><tr><td>Pay</td><td>USD $138,000 to $300,000 a year in base pay, plus bonus, equity and benefits</td></tr><tr><td>Application dates</td><td>Posted 17 to 20 November 2026; no closing date stated</td></tr><tr><td>Application route</td><td>Online through Google Careers</td></tr><tr><td>Qualification</td><td>Relevant degree and experience; 8 or more years for the staff engineer post</td></tr><tr><td>Selection</td><td>Application and interview; English proficiency is required for global collaboration</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>What jobs in Google USA involve</h2><p>Google's software engineers are the next-generation technologies that change the way billions of people connect, explore and interact with information. The Staff Software Engineer in AI & ML is a staff level role in Generative AI (Sunnyvale or New York) with eight or more years experience. The Senior Business Data Scientist in Google Cloud is in Sunnyvale working on customer journey and product analytics to shape the product and support experience. The Business Data Scientist in AI Foundations is in San Jose. The Senior Software Engineer for Discover Feed Recommendations is in Mountain View. Google posted 95 developer roles over the last seven days, through 24 November 2026) with 75 of those in the San Francisco Bay Area. Those looking to explore other <a href="https://growentix.cloud/usa">USA jobs</a> can also take a look at our guide to <a href="https://growentix.cloud/articles/software-engineer-jobs-in-usa-for-foreigners-h-1b-pay-and-hiring-guide-20261029">s