(gen_random_uuid(), 'jobs-in-samsung-usa-20261125', 'usa', 'USA',
'Jobs in Samsung USA: Engineer Roles Pay Up to $253,000',
'Jobs in Samsung USA: Engineer Roles Pay Up to $253,000',
'Jobs in Samsung USA number 454 open US posts, including a Staff Engineer in San Jose paying $163,000 to $253,000 and a sales manager at up to $218,000.',
'Jobs in Samsung USA number 454 open US posts, including a Staff Engineer in San Jose paying $163,000 to $253,000 and a sales manager at up to $218,000.',
$$<p>Samsung Electronics is hiring across the United States, with 454 open US posts as of 24 November 2026 and 245 of them new in the last 30 days. Jobs in Samsung USA in this roundup pay $106,000 to $253,000 a year, concentrated in Texas, California, and New Jersey.</p><table><tbody><tr><td>Organisation</td><td>Samsung Electronics, Samsung Semiconductor and Samsung Electronics America</td></tr><tr><td>Post</td><td>Staff Engineer, Senior Manager Technical Sales, Senior Instrumentation and Controls Network Engineer</td></tr><tr><td>Pay</td><td>$106,000 to $253,000 a year, depending on the role</td></tr><tr><td>Application dates</td><td>Open now; no closing date stated on the listings checked</td></tr><tr><td>Application route</td><td>Online through Samsung Careers, via Workday</td></tr><tr><td>Qualification</td><td>Relevant engineering degree and experience; semiconductor process or firmware background for the staff roles</td></tr><tr><td>Selection</td><td>Application and interview; a limit of 10 applications per candidate across 6 months applies</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>What jobs in Samsung USA involve</h2><p>Samsung's American hiring splits across three businesses. Samsung Semiconductor in San Jose needs Staff Engineers in process integration and firmware for data centre SSDs, working daily on site at the San Jose office to grow the company's memory business and build technology leadership. Samsung Electronics America in Berkeley Heights, New Jersey, is hiring a Senior Manager for technical sales in intelligent radio access networks, selling network systems to operators. Samsung Austin Semiconductor in Taylor, Texas, is hiring engineers and technicians for one of the most advanced semiconductor facilities in the United States, including a Senior Instrumentation and Controls Network Engineer at $106,000 to $145,000. The newest posts include a Cleans Process Engineer and a Senior Technician in Taylor, both posted on 24 November 2026. Readers exploring other <a href="https://growentix.cloud/usa">USA jobs</a> can also read our report on <a href="https://growentix.cloud/articles/seasonal-remote-jobs-holiday-hiring-november-2026-20261121">seasonal remote jobs hiring in November 2026</a>, a very different kind of opening for the same month.</p><h2>Who can apply</h2><p>The Staff Engineer posting is for experienced semiconductor engineers with a strong track record in process integration or firmware. The San Jose roles are on-site. The Technical Sales Manager role requires senior level solutions and sales engineering experience in the area of networks and that role is not open to immigration sponsorship. All of the Samsung Austin Semiconductor postings are full time and on-site. Samsung have a limit of 10 applications per candidate across all open roles in any 6 month period so you should be selective in your applications and only apply to those you feel are the best fit.</p><h2>What it pays</h2><p>The San Jose Staff Engineer posts pay a base range of $163,000 to $253,000 a year, the highest in this roundup, with pay varying by work location, knowledge, skills and experience. The Senior Manager, Technical Sales, pays $176,500 to $218,000 for candidates based in New York or New Jersey. The Austin instrumentation engineer pays $106,000 to $145,000. Across the 285 open Samsung US postings that state pay, the median top of the posted range is $145,000 a year, with the middle half running from $120,000 to $175,000. Most open posts are in Dallas, Austin and the San Francisco Bay Area.</p><h2>How to apply</h2><p>Apply via Samsung Careers (uses Workday) and you have to create an account first. There's no stated closing date on the listings we've checked so they could well close when filled. Given the 10 application limit over six months, applicants should read each posting through in full and apply accordingly, prioritising the roles that are most relevant to your experience.</p><h2>What the notice does not say</h2><p>There's no closing date on any of the listings we've checked, no interview dates or start dates are given and there's no indication of how many posts there are for each role. Only the technical sales post explicitly states its sponsorship position, so international applicants should check the sponsorship line on each live listing before they apply.</p><p><strong>Never pay anyone to apply for this job.</strong> Samsung Careers applications are free and Samsung will never ask you to pay anything for an application, an assessment or a job offer.</p><p>Sources: <a href="https://donutapply.com/companies/samsungelectronics/">DonutApply</a> (Samsung Electronics open US jobs as counted from the employer's own site: 454 posts, pay medians and locations); <a href="https://yabot.jobs/jobs/us/engineering-traditional/2026-11-02/staff-engineer-process-integration-san-jose-ca-1325568a-316a-4672-a207-5d5e1133248b">Yabot Jobs</a> (the Samsung Semiconductor Staff Engineer listing as published: pay range and duties); <a href="https://growthroles.com/jobs/sec-sr-manager-technical-sales-ossnms-intelligent-ran-ric-0bed98916e89d564">GrowthRoles</a> (the Samsung Senior Manager, Technical Sales listing as published: pay range and sponsorship note).</p><h2>Frequently asked questions</h2><h3>How many jobs does Samsung have open in the USA?</h3><p>454 open US posts as of 24th November 2026, 245 of which were new in the last 30 days.</p><h3>What's the highest paid Samsung role?</h3><p>The Staff Engineer posts in San Jose, at $163,000 to $253,000 a year.</p><h3>Where is Samsung currently hiring the most in the USA?</h3><p>Dallas, Austin and the San Francisco Bay Area, with 107 open posts in Dallas and 96 in Austin.</p><h3>Is there a cap on the number of Samsung jobs I can apply for?</h3><p>Yes. Each candidate is capped at 10 applications across all open roles within a 6 month period.</p>
$$,
$$<p>Samsung Electronics is hiring across the United States, with 454 open US posts as of 24 November 2026 and 245 of them new in the last 30 days. Jobs in Samsung USA in this roundup pay $106,000 to $253,000 a year, concentrated in Texas, California, and New Jersey.</p><table><tbody><tr><td>Organisation</td><td>Samsung Electronics, Samsung Semiconductor and Samsung Electronics America</td></tr><tr><td>Post</td><td>Staff Engineer, Senior Manager Technical Sales, Senior Instrumentation and Controls Network Engineer</td></tr><tr><td>Pay</td><td>$106,000 to $253,000 a year, depending on the role</td></tr><tr><td>Application dates</td><td>Open now; no closing date stated on the listings checked</td></tr><tr><td>Application route</td><td>Online through Samsung Careers, via Workday</td></tr><tr><td>Qualification</td><td>Relevant engineering degree and experience; semiconductor process or firmware background for the staff roles</td></tr><tr><td>Selection</td><td>Application and interview; a limit of 10 applications per candidate across 6 months applies</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>What jobs in Samsung USA involve</h2><p>Samsung's American hiring splits across three businesses. Samsung Semiconductor in San Jose needs Staff Engineers in process integration and firmware for data centre SSDs, working daily on site at the San Jose office to grow the company's memory business and build technology leadership. Samsung Electronics America in Berkeley Heights, New Jersey, is hiring a Senior Manager for technical sales in intelligent radio access networks, selling network systems to operators. Samsung Austin Semiconductor in Taylor, Texas, is hiring engineers and technicians for one of the most advanced semiconductor facilities in the United States, including a Senior Instrumentation and Controls Network Engineer at $106,000 to $145,000. The newest posts include a Cleans Process Engineer and a Senior Technician in Taylor, both posted on 24 November 2026. Readers exploring other <a hr