 we looked at so they will close when filled. You'll need to demonstrate native Japanese and the requisite translation/localisation/technical experience for the role.</p><h2>What the notice does not say</h2><p>There's no closing date on any of the listings that we've checked and for the majority of the roles there's no guaranteed weekly hour count is guaranteed for most roles. The listings don't state how many posts there are for each role and they don't state whether the work would lead to a longer term position. None of the listings state that it's a visa position as it's remote and contract work so applicants should check the location restriction on each listing prior to applying.</p><p><strong>Never pay anyone to apply for this job.</strong> All applications to Begun, Mercor, micro1 and Welocalize are free and no real platform will ever ask you to pay anything for an application, an assessment or a job offer.</p><p>Sources: <a href="https://aitrainer.jobs/jobs/120024-japanese-language-cultural-fluency-consultant-ethos">AI Trainer Jobs</a> (the Begun Japanese Language and Cultural Fluency Consultant listing: pay, hours and duties); <a href="https://hiring.sojistudio.com/jobs/japanese-linguistic-experts">SOJI Studio</a> (the Mercor Japanese Linguistic Experts listing: pay, location and requirements); <a href="https://remotive.com/remote/jobs/all-others/bilingual-japanese-language-specialist-6488421">Remotive</a> (the Mercor Bilingual Japanese Language Specialist listing: pay, location and duties).</p><h2>Frequently asked questions</h2><h3>What's the highest paid remote Japanese role?</h3><p>The Japanese Language and Cultural Fluency Consultant at Begun, $100 an hour for 5 to 20 hours per week.</p><h3>Do I need to be a native Japanese speaker?</h3><p>Yes. The roles are looking for native or near-native Japanese with a very strong command of grammar, syntax and style.</p><h3>Are these full-time jobs?</h3><p>No, most are part time/contract roles with flexible hours rather than fixed full time positions.</p><h3>Can I apply from anywhere in the world?</h3><p>Some roles are fully remote worldwide, others are restricted to Japan or East Asia so be sure to check the location restrictions on each listing.</p>
