-- remote-jobs-project-manager-20261125 (remote; USA; verifiedAt 2026-11-25)
INSERT INTO "Article" ("id", "slug", "category", "country", "titleEn", "titleNe", "excerptEn", "excerptNe", "bodyEn", "bodyNe", "sources", "publishedAt", "createdAt", "updatedAt", "verifiedAt", "authorName")
VALUES
(gen_random_uuid(), 'remote-jobs-project-manager-20261125', 'remote', 'USA',
'Remote Jobs Project Manager Roles Pay Up to $200,000',
'Remote Jobs Project Manager Roles Pay Up to $200,000',
'Remote jobs project manager roles are open now, including a CrowdStrike senior post paying $140,000 to $200,000 and a Leidos IT role at up to $157,450.',
'Remote jobs project manager roles are open now, including a CrowdStrike senior post paying $140,000 to $200,000 and a Leidos IT role at up to $157,450.',
$$<p>Employers are hiring project managers to lead distributed teams with remote roles available across energy, defence, health and cyber security. Remote jobs project manager roles in this roundup are paying between $87,100 and $200,000 a year, and most are open to US based in the United States.</p><table><tbody><tr><td>Organisation</td><td>Leidos, Syner-G, GovCIO, CrowdStrike, Computer Task Group</td></tr><tr><td>Post</td><td>IT Project Manager, Project Manager (Strategy and Transformation), Professional Services Senior Project Manager</td></tr><tr><td>Pay</td><td>$87,100 to $200,000 a year, depending on the role; one contract role pays up to $48 an hour</td></tr><tr><td>Application dates</td><td>Open now; the CrowdStrike post lists an expected close date of 16 January 2027</td></tr><tr><td>Application route</td><td>Online through the employer's careers page or the listing board</td></tr><tr><td>Qualification</td><td>Proven project delivery experience; PMP or equivalent preferred for senior roles</td></tr><tr><td>Selection</td><td>Application and interview; some roles require security clearance or suitability checks</td></tr></tbody></table><h2>What remote jobs project manager roles involve</h2><p>A remote project manager plans, coordinates and delivers projects from inception to closeout, keeping the teams, budgets and timelines in line without the benefit of being in the same office. At Leidos the IT Project Manager is working on the energy efficiency portfolio for the Ameren Illinois service territory from a remote location near Peoria with up to 10% local travel. Syner-G are looking for a Project Manager to lead on strategy and transformation work, leading cross-functional projects and the roll out of AI tools across the business. CrowdStrike are seeking a Professional Services Senior Project Manager to lead the deployment of their platform services to customers. GovCIO are also seeking an IT Project Manager to work on their technology projects across the organisation. For readers looking at other <a href="https://growentix.cloud/remote">remote opportunities</a> we have a report on the <a href="https://growentix.cloud/articles/it-project-manager-jobs-in-germany-disa-vaihingen-20261124">IT Project Manager role in Germany</a> (a very different on-site role with a fixed close date).</p><h2>Who can apply</h2><p>These are roles for experienced project managers who can demonstrate end to end delivery across distributed teams. Leidos are looking for project management experience in the energy sector or a related field and the role is remote with the candidate required to live in the Peoria area. The GovCIO role requires the successful candidate to achieve and maintain HUD suitability. CrowdStrike are looking for more than ten years experience at a senior level. The Computer Task Group Global Media Project Manager role is worldwide remote and involves managing a global media mix modelling programme for 12 months or more. Most of the other roles are USA only so those outside the US should check the location restriction on each role.</p><h2>What it pays</h2><p>CrowdStrike is the highest earner in this list at $140,000 to $200,000 a year plus bonuses, equity and benefits. Syner-G pays $120,000 to $140,000 a year. Leidos pays $87,100 to $157,450. GovCIO pays $94,150 to $120,000 a year. The Computer Task Group contract role is up to $48 an hour. In the wider market for advertised remote project managers the pay varies quite a bit by level: the junior postings advertise around $85,000 to $108,000, mid-level $110,000 to $157,000, and senior or staff roles $160,000 to $215,000 a year.</p><h2>How to apply</h2><p>Apply via the employer's careers page or the job listing where you found the role. Leidos says its requisition will be open for at least three days from the 20th November 2026 posting and CrowdStrike has an expected close date of 16th January 2027. The other roles in this roundup have no stated close date so early application should demonstrate tangible delivery in the safer course. Applications should show concrete evidence of projects delivered, budgets managed, stakeholders engaged and outcomes achieved with remote teams.</p><h2>What the notice does not say</h2><p>Most of the listings provide no closing date at all and none give a start date or number of posts. Leidos state their pay range is purely a general guide and is not a guarantee of pay. None of the listings in this roundup indicate whether visa sponsorship is available and several are expressly USA only so international applicants should check eligibility prior to applying.</p><p><strong>Never pay anyone to apply for this job.</strong> All applications to Leidos, Syner-G, GovCIO, CrowdStrike and Computer Task Group are free and no real employer would ever ask you to pay to apply, to interview or to take up a job.</p><p>Sources: <a href="https://remotive.com/remote/jobs/project-management/it-project-manager-6674167">Remotive</a> (the Leidos IT Project Manager listing: pay range, posting date and location); <a href="https://remotive.com/remote/jobs/project-management/project-manager-6644792">Remotive</a> (the Syner-G Project Manager listing: pay range and duties); <a href="https://secondsummit.ai/job-details/project-management/remote/crowdstrike-professional-services-senior-project-manager-remot-c2040d/">SecondSummit</a> (the CrowdStrike Senior Project Manager listing as published on the employer's board: pay range and expected close date).</p><h2>Frequently asked questions</h2><h3>What's the best paid remote project manager role?</h3><p>The CrowdStrike Professional Services Senior Project Manager, at $140,000 to $200,000 a year plus bonuses and equity.</p><h3>Can I apply from outside the United States?</h3><p>Most roles in this roundup are USA-only, but the Computer Task Group Global Media Project Manager role is listed as worldwide remote.</p><h3>When do applications close?</h3><p>CrowdStrike lists an expected close date of 16 January 2027; the other listings state no fixed closing date.</p><h3>Do I need a PMP certificate?</h3><p>The listings ask for proven delivery experience, and a PMP or equivalent is preferred for senior roles rather than stated as mandatory.</p>
$$,
