uld demonstrate tangible delivery in the safer course. Applications should show concrete evidence of projects delivered, budgets managed, stakeholders engaged and outcomes achieved with remote teams.</p><h2>What the notice does not say</h2><p>Most of the listings provide no closing date at all and none give a start date or number of posts. Leidos state their pay range is purely a general guide and is not a guarantee of pay. None of the listings in this roundup indicate whether visa sponsorship is available and several are expressly USA only so international applicants should check eligibility prior to applying.</p><p><strong>Never pay anyone to apply for this job.</strong> All applications to Leidos, Syner-G, GovCIO, CrowdStrike and Computer Task Group are free and no real employer would ever ask you to pay to apply, to interview or to take up a job.</p><p>Sources: <a href="https://remotive.com/remote/jobs/project-management/it-project-manager-6674167">Remotive</a> (the Leidos IT Project Manager listing: pay range, posting date and location); <a href="https://remotive.com/remote/jobs/project-management/project-manager-6644792">Remotive</a> (the Syner-G Project Manager listing: pay range and duties); <a href="https://secondsummit.ai/job-details/project-management/remote/crowdstrike-professional-services-senior-project-manager-remot-c2040d/">SecondSummit</a> (the CrowdStrike Senior Project Manager listing as published on the employer's board: pay range and expected close date).</p><h2>Frequently asked questions</h2><h3>What's the best paid remote project manager role?</h3><p>The CrowdStrike Professional Services Senior Project Manager, at $140,000 to $200,000 a year plus bonuses and equity.</p><h3>Can I apply from outside the United States?</h3><p>Most roles in this roundup are USA-only, but the Computer Task Group Global Media Project Manager role is listed as worldwide remote.</p><h3>When do applications close?</h3><p>CrowdStrike lists an expected close date of 16 January 2027; the other listings state no fixed closing date.</p><h3>Do I need a PMP certificate?</h3><p>The listings ask for proven delivery experience, and a PMP or equivalent is preferred for senior roles rather than stated as mandatory.</p>
